### StudyPlanner REST API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Олена Коваль",
  "email": "olena@example.com",
  "password": "Study2026!"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "olena@example.com",
  "password": "Study2026!"
}

### Get current user (requires sp_session cookie)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List disciplines
GET http://localhost:3000/api/disciplines

### Create discipline
POST http://localhost:3000/api/disciplines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Архітектура комп'ютера",
  "colorIndex": 1
}

### List tasks (with optional filters)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
# GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?q=звіт&done=false&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Create task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Лабораторна робота №5",
  "description": "Реалізувати full-stack застосунок",
  "disciplineId": "REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_UUID",
  "deadline": "2026-11-30"
}

### Toggle done
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Delete account (cascades all data)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/account
Content-Type: application/json

{}
